          "Annotate strong owners and weak delegate/controller references; identify who keeps each callback target alive.",
          "Read optional-fetch code and base finish behavior; write one precise cleanup-policy question with source evidence.",
          "Map query, coordinator, snapshot, and UI tests to the requirements they cover and identify what direct callback tests do not execute.",
