          "Choose six bounded rows covering pure contract, generated/retained consumers, Release packaging, affected extension, and runtime compatibility.",
          "For each row, specify build configuration, plan configuration/options, destination, runtime fixtures, evidence type, and pass criteria.",
          "Write a build-for-testing/test-without-building pairing contract and expected test-discovery checks.",
