        "prompt": "Design deterministic cancellation and stale-response tests, distinguishing pre-cancelled work from cancellation after the service has started.",
        "scenario": "A synthetic loading model has an injectable async service. The existing test cancels immediately after creating a Task. A proposed overlapping-request test waits ten milliseconds before starting B.",
        "androidBridge": "Kotlin coroutine test schedulers and controlled fakes help establish ordering rather than wall-clock luck. Swift Task.yield and sleep are not equivalents of runTest's scheduling controls; XCTest expectations or explicit async signals must encode the event you need to observe.",
