        "androidBridge": "Kotlin/Java RecyclerView stable IDs and DiffUtil suggest separating item identity from displayed content. UIKit snapshots use Hashable identifiers and explicit reconfiguration; RecyclerView payload and onBindViewHolder behavior is not an exact counterpart.",
